            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cartan-Eilenberg+spectral+sequence"} Cartan-Eilenberg spectral sequence
            to be multiplicative. This is due to (
            %a{:href => "#Douady58"}> Douady 58
            ). The following is taken from (
            %a{:href => "#Goette15"}> Goette 15a
            ).
